---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Terms & Conditions', href: '/terms' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | CUMID Stationery"
  description="Terms of service and preorder enquiry rules for CUMID (cumid.store). Clarifies enquiry-only status, zero website payments, and batch purchasing terms."
  canonicalUrl={`${SITE.canonicalUrl}/terms`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-10">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

    <header class="space-y-3 pb-6 border-b border-charcoal-800/10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-lavender-700">
        Terms of Service &amp; Preorders
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-charcoal-900 tracking-tight">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700/70">
        Last Meaningful Update: October 15, 2026 · Market: India
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-charcoal text-charcoal-800 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using the website <strong>https://cumid.store</strong> ("the Website"), you agree to these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">2. Current Launch Mode: Preorder Enquiries Only</h2>
      <p>
        The Website operates currently as a design catalog and preorder enquiry portal.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        <li><strong>All Products Sold Out:</strong> All candidate diary designs listed on the website are currently out of stock or in design preview.</li>
        <li><strong>Enquiry is Not an Order:</strong> Clicking "Enquire about preorder on WhatsApp" or sending a message to our WhatsApp does NOT constitute a binding contract, stock reservation, or finalized purchase order.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Online Payments:</strong> We do not collect payments, credit/debit card numbers, UPI handles, or banking credentials through this website. Any future transaction will be confirmed directly with verified instructions on our official WhatsApp.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">3. Product Descriptions &amp; Design Previews</h2>
      <p>
        Cover graphics labelled "Design preview" represent creative artwork mockups. They illustrate the visual concept and top-spiral pocket format. Confirmed paper weight (GSM), exact millimetre dimensions, sheet counts, and cover finishes are confirmed by the brand owner prior to batch production and shared during WhatsApp consultation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">4. User Conduct &amp; Account Responsibility</h2>
      <p>
        If you create an optional customer account via Google sign-in:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your Google credentials.</li>
        <li>You agree not to use automated bots, scrapers, or reverse-engineering tools to compromise our servers or Supabase database.</li>
        <li>You may terminate your account at any time through our self-service deletion control.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All original artwork, illustrations, typography, logos (including the CUMID wordmark and spiral "C" symbol), and editorial articles published on cumid.store are the intellectual property of CUMID and protected under Indian copyright law. Unauthorized copying, reproduction, or commercial resale of cover designs is strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive for accurate information, CUMID provides the website on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We are not liable for transient network disruptions, third-party platform downtime (such as WhatsApp, Cloudflare, or Supabase), or unforeseen manufacturing delays prior to order confirmation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">7. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Republic of India. Any disputes arising out of the use of this website shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in India.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">8. Contact for Legal Notices</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding these Terms, contact our customer channel via WhatsApp at <strong>{SITE.whatsappDisplayNumber}</strong>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
